WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
# THE ANGELS HAVE GONE #.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.670
# THE SONGS HAVE GONE SILENT #.

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:35.620
# YOU'RE SINKING LIKE A STONE #.

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:41.020
# BEFORE THE TIDE #.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:45.600
# THE RIVER RUNS CO-O-LD #.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.360
# THE FIGHT IS OVER #.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:53.850
# STILL THE HAUNTED.
RUINS OF NIGHT #.

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:57.030
# CALL YOUR NAME #.

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:09.210
MM-HMM.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:11.050
YES.

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:15.970
YES.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:21.720
INTO THE UNKNOWN.

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:33.480
GOODBYE!

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:35.490
THANK YOU, OLD LADY DANIELS.

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:36.710
GOODBYE, GREGORY.

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:38.410
AND PLEASE DON'T CALL ME OLD LADY.

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:39.950
YES, SIR, YOUNG MAN!

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:41.410
HEY, WIRT, WHATCHA DOING?

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:42.410
NOTHING.

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:45.200
I WAS HELPING OLD LADY DANIELS RAKE SOME LEAVES

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.000
IN EXCHANGE FOR CANDY.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.830
GREG, IT'S HALLOWEEN.

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:49.670
CANDY IS FREE.

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:53.250
OLD LADY DANIELS SAYS NOTHING
IN THIS WORLD IS FREE.

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:56.010
OH, HEY, AND LOOK!

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:58.010
I ALSO GOT THIS ROCK.

00:01:58.010 --> 00:01:58.930
HEY, WIRT,

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:01.430
WANNA LEARN SOME ROCK FACTS?

00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:06.800
SO, YOU WANT TO GO LOOK FOR FROGS WITH ME

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:08.440
LIKE YOU SAID YOU WOULD AWHILE AGO

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:09.520
AND HAVEN'T DONE IT YET?

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:11.610
NAH. NAH, I'M BUSY.

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:14.450
IS THAT BEE NAMED SARA?

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:15.290
W-WHAT?

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:17.290
YOUR TAPE SAYS "FOR SARA."

00:02:17.290 --> 00:02:19.610
ARE YOU GONNA GIVE IT TO
SARA THE BEE?

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:21.810
I-I WANT TO, BUT...

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:22.570
I CAN'T.

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:24.020
CAN I SEE IT?

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:25.950
YEAH. IT'S JUST A TAPE.

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:27.610
HMM. YEAH. OKAY,

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:28.960
I'LL GIVE IT TO HER FOR YOU.

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:31.710
OH, GREG! W-WAIT! NO, NO!

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:32.790
OH, LOOK AT YOU.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:34.210
WHAT ARE YOU SUPPOSED TO BE?

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:35.830
IT'S AN ELEPHANT COSTUME.

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:38.370
BRRRH, BRRRH... PBHT!

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:39.630
SEE MY TRUNK?

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.460
YEAH THAT'S... CUTE.

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:42.150
I'M AN EGG!

00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:43.310
YEAH, EVERYBODY KNOWS YOU'RE AN EGG, RHONDI.

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:44.180
SHUT IT, KATHLEEN.

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:44.860
WHATEVER.

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:46.370
SO, WHAT ARE YOU, WIRT?

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:47.730
SOME KIND OF GNOME?

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:50.130
UH, I D... I DON'T KNOW.
WELL, IT'S ... SEE, I WAS ...

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:50.730
I THOUGHT I'D JUST, LIKE...

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:52.150
HEY! WHAT'S THIS!

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:53.980
THAT'S WIRT'S TAPE FOR SARA.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:56.480
OOH! WIRT LOVES SARA!

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:58.480
YOU WANT US TO GIVE IT TO HER?

00:02:58.480 --> 00:02:59.860
UH, IT'S FOR A DIFFERENT SARA...

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.070
NOT THE ONE YOU'RE THINKING ABOUT.

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.700
YEAH, WIRT'S TALKING ABOUT
MASCOT SARA...

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.580
THE ONE HE'S BEEN LOOKING AT ALL NIGHT.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:05.990
WHA...?!

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:10.000
OOH! WIRT'S GOT A CRUSH ON SARA.

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:10.000
HA, HA, HA! AHA, HA, HA!

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.000
WELL, YOU BETTER ACT FAST 'CAUSE WE HEARD

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.090
JASON FUNDERBERKER IS GONNA ASK HER OUT AT THE HALLOWEEN PARTY TONIGHT.

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:16.250
JASON FUNDERBERKER?

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.260
- YEAH!
- YEAH!

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:17.920
...YEAH.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:21.010
WHAT I.. BUT.. BUT, UM...

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.010
YOU OKAY, WIRT?

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:23.010
YEAH! EVERYTHING'S...

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.510
EVERYTHING'S JASON FUNDERBERKER.

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:25.100
- WHAT?
- WHAT?

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:26.100
UH, UH...

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:28.100
JASON FUNDERBERKER,
I-I GOT TO GO.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:29.100
BYE!

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:36.620
IS THE DOVE NEVER TO MEET THE SEA

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:38.870
FOR WANT OF THE ODIOUS MOUNTAIN?

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.200
HEY, SO...

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:41.970
FROG HUNT?

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:42.280
HUH?

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:44.280
I KEEP HEARING RIBBITING AROUND TOWN,

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:46.530
AND I THINK IT'S
THE LAST FROG OF THE SEASON.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:49.240
NO, I JUST WANT TO WALLOW IN MISERY.

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:52.030
SARA AND JASON FUNDERBERKER. UGH.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:53.280
THAT GUY'S GOT HIS ACT TOGETHER.

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:55.170
HE'S THE TOTAL PACKAGE. I CAN'T COMPETE.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:57.570
YOU'RE THE TOTAL PACKAGE, TOO, WIRT.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.380
I BET SHE'LL REALLY LIKE YOUR TAPE.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:01.060
HUH! WE NEVER GOT THE TAPE BACK!

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:02.220
I CAN'T LET HER HEAR THAT TAPE!

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:03.050
WHY NOT?

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:06.500
THAT TAPE HAS GOT POETRY AND CLARINET ON IT, GREG.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.060
POETRY AND CLARINET!

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:10.720
SARA AND JASON
FUNDERBERKER ARE GONNA START DATING,

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:11.840
AND THEN THEY'LL HEAR THAT TAPE,

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:13.430
AND THEN THEY'LL JUST SIT AND LISTEN TO IT

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:15.390
AND LAUGH AND LAUGH AND LAUGH AND LAUGH.

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:17.520
WHY DON'T YOU ASK SARA OUT FIRST?

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:18.000
THAT WAY-

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.020
NO, NO! UGH!

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:20.530
WHY DID YOU HAVE TO TAKE THE TAPE?

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.360
MY LIFE IS CRUMBLING ALL AROUND ME!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:25.360
OKAY, I THINK WE SHOULD PUT OUR FROG HUNT ON HOLD

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:26.990
AND GO GET THAT TAPE BACK.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:35.000
GUYS, WHERE'S THE TAPE?

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.920
WE PUT IT IN SARA'S JACKET FOR YOU.

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:40.590
YOU BETTER HURRY. SHE'S CHANGING IN THE TRACK SHACK.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:41.340
'SCUSE ME.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:41.920
WUH-OH!

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:43.330
THE JACKET!

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:47.880
HEY! ARE YOU TRYING TO SPY ON SARA?

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:49.060
UH... NO.

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:50.180
RUN, GREG!

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.060
HEY, SARA, BE CAREFUL, HUH?

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.920
THERE'S SOME REAL CREEPS OUT THERE TONIGHT.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:56.810
THANKS, JIMMY.

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:03.760
HEY, YOU TWO ROBBERS,
YOU'RE UNDER ARREST.

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:06.070
NAH, I'M JUST KIDDING. HAPPY HALLOWEEN.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.650
HEY, STOP RUNNING IN THE STREET!

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:11.330
JUST KIDDING. HAPPY HALLOWEEN.

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:14.410
THERE SHE GOES. LET'S GET HER.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:17.000
YEAH, LET'S GET HER.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:18.930
NO, W-WE'RE NOT GONNA GET HER LIKE THAT.

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:20.000
WHAT ARE WE DOING?

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.310
WE'RE JUST GONNA GET THE TAPE BACK.

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:23.240
OH, YEAH!
LET'S GO IN AFTER HER.

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:24.810
HUH... I CAN'T.

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:26.260
I WASN'T INVITED TO THIS PARTY.

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:27.010
I'LL GO IN!

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:28.090
YOU WEREN'T INVITED EITHER.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:28.760
OH.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.060
YEAH, MAN, THERE'S LOTS OF.
BAT-AND-BALL GAMES BESIDES BASEBALL

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.770
...ONE OLD CAT, TWO OLD CAT, STOOLBALL, ROUNDBALL...

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:37.940
WHY ARE YOU TALKING TO THEM?

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.090
OH. HEY...GUYS.

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:45.110
I DON'T KNOW WHAT HE SAID, BUT I-IT WASN'T TRUE.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:46.350
- OH, HEY, WIRT.
- HOW'S IT GOING?

00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:46.820
HI, WIRT!

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:48.610
OH. UH, YEAH.

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:50.780
WELL, SEE YOU AROUND, GUYS.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:53.010
I USED TO BE REALLY GOOD AT BALLET,

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:55.010
BUT MY MOM WANTED ME TO BE A WRESTLER.

00:05:55.010 --> 00:05:56.530
OH, WIRT. YOU'RE HERE.

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:57.370
WELL, I...

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:59.290
I WAS JUST ASKING IF YOU WERE HERE.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:00.520
OH, WOW.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:03.210
OH, HEY, WE'RE GONNA
GO TO THE GRAVEYARD.

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:04.910
OH. ARE YOU GONNA...

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:05.800
DO SOMETHING THERE?

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.540
NAH, WE'RE JUST GONNA HANG OUT

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:09.390
AND DRINK AGE-APPROPRIATE DRINKS.

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:11.390
- LIKE JUICE?
- YEAH, WHATEVER.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.560
AGE-APPROPRIATE STUFF THAT'S NOT ILLEGAL.

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.970
HEY, YOU SHOULD COME.

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:15.890
UH, I DON'T ...

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:20.150
HEY, SARA.
ARE YOU READY TO GO?

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.150
HEY, JASON FUNDERBERKER.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.730
OH, HEY, WIRT.

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:26.450
LET'S GO, SARA.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:27.240
YOU COMING, WIRT?

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:29.240
NO, NO. YOU... YOU GO...

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:31.570
HAVE FUN WITH JASON FUNDERBERKER.

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:32.580
OKAY.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:35.580
BUT IF YOU WANT TO STOP BYE LATER OR SOMETHING...

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:36.660
MM. BYE, WIRT.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:39.670
SAYONARA, JASON FUNDERBERKER.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:40.580
HUH!

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:41.670
SARA'S JACKET!

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.050
MY JACKET! THANKS, WIRT.

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:46.420
WELL, SEE YA ... HOPEFULLY.

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:47.090
BYE.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.700
YOU'RE LIMITING THE UNIVERSE.

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:52.910
TO ONLY THINGS HUMANS.
COULD UNDERSTAND.

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:54.370
WELL, YOU'RE LIMITING THE UNIVERSE.

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:56.770
BY LIMITING THE POSSIBILITY.
OF HUMAN UNDERSTANDING.

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:57.930
OH, YEAH. MAYBE.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:59.120
SARA.

00:06:59.120 --> 00:06:59.730
YEAH?

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:01.760
DO YOU BELIEVE IN...

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:03.180
GHOSTS?

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:03.940
WHY?

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:06.940
CAUSE THERE'S ONE RIGHT BEHIND YOU!

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:08.320
AW, I'M JUST KIDDING.

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.780
IT'S OKAY, FUNDERBERKER.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.780
STOP! YOU HIT ME!

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.280
COME ON.

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:15.620
GRAAWR.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.450
WIRT, YOU TRICKED ME!

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:21.170
I DIDN'T KNOW THIS WAS A FROG HUNT ALL ALONG.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:22.170
IT NEVER WAS A...

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:22.710
HUH!

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:24.250
A WITCHES GATHERING!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:29.260
A GUY WITH AN AXE SHOWED UP!

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.900
UGH.
EVERYBODY LOVES FUNDERBERKER.

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:33.990
WHAT DO I DO?

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:35.570
I'LL PRETEND TO BE A DEAD ELEPHANT

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:38.020
AND DISTRACT THEM WHILE YOU GET THE TAPE.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:39.020
PLEASE JUST STAY HERE.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:42.350
AND SO SHE KEPT GETTING CLOSER...

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:45.020
AND CLOSER...

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:46.020
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?.

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:46.960
- JASON, HEHE
- HEHE

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:48.270
OH, JASON...

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:51.650
GO, GREG. DO IT.

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:52.110
OKAY.

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:54.690
UH... YOU CAN LET GO OF OF MY HAND NOW.

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:56.460
OH... YEAH.

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:58.450
YOU COULD HOLD MY HAND, FUNDERBERKER. I DON'T CARE.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:00.770
WOOOOOOOH,

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:01.870
WAH WAH WAH!

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.460
HEY, ISN'T THAT WIRT'S LITTLE BROTHER?

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:05.140
NOOOOO,

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:07.460
I AM THE HEADLESS ELEPHANT!

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:11.330
IS WIRT HERE, TOO?

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:12.050
OVER THERE!

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:14.470
THERE HE IS.

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.720
WIRT, WE CAN SEE YOU, MAN.

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:19.470
OH. HEY, GUYS.

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.330
GREG! THERE YOU ARE.

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:22.980
TOTALLY WASN'T SPYING ON ANYBODY.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:23.990
I WAS JUST LOOKING FOR ...

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:25.560
WHAT'S GOING ON HERE?.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:26.310
HUH!

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:28.530
IS THIS SOME KIND OF
WITCHES' GATHERING?

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:30.610
YOU'RE ALL UNDER ARREST.

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:31.320
RUN!

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:32.980
HEY, HEY! I WAS JUST KIDDING.

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:35.070
SLOW DOWN, KIDS.
YOU'RE GONNA TRIP OR SOMETHING.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:37.580
RUN, RUN, RUN!
RUN, RUN, RUN!

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:38.660
WHERE DO WE GO?

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:39.840
THAT WAY!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.150
GREG! WHY DID YOU SAY THIS WAY?

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:44.620
I THOUGHT I HEARD A FROG.

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:47.170
THIS IS PRIVATE PROPERTY.

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.170
UH...

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:51.840
HEY, DON'T CLIMB UP THERE.
THAT'S DANGEROUS!

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:54.050
GET DOWN HERE BEFORE.
YOU HURT YOURSELF!

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:55.300
HUH?

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.140
IT HAS MY NAME ON IT.

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.890
LET'S GO LISTEN TO IT.

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:04.270
NOOOOOOO!

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:07.440
KIDS, REALLY, GET DOWN FROM
THAT WALL.

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:09.860
THAT'S IT. THAT'S THE END.

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:11.150
NO, DARN IT. NO.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:12.280
I MEAN COME DOWN THIS WAY.

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:16.860
ONCE AGAIN, YOU RUIN MY LIFE.

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:17.780
WHO? ME?

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.780
UGH! YOU AND YOUR STUPID DAD!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.020
YOU'RE ALWAYS PRODDING ME,

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:22.500
TRYING TO GET ME TO JOIN
MARCHING BAND.

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:24.730
OH, YEAH!
IF YOU JOIN THE MARCHING BAND,

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:26.420
YOU COULD HANG OUT WITH SARA MORE!

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:28.420
THAT SHIP HAS SAILED, GREG.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.170
THANKS TO YOU MESSING THAT UP, TOO.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.010
GRAAWR.

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.510
HOLD THAT THOUGHT, WIRT.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:36.510
WHAT ARE YOU DOING NOW?

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:38.840
HAHA! WE FOUND OUR LUCKY FROG.

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:42.010
WE GOT TO NAME HIM FOR GOOD LUCK.

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:45.160
I DON'T WANT TO HAVE ANYTHING TO DO WITH YOU OR THAT FROG!

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:47.850
OKAY, I'LL TRY TO THINK OF A NAME MYSELF.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:49.520
UGH. I'M LEAVING.

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:50.360
HMM?

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:51.190
HUH?

00:09:58.510 --> 00:10:00.870
# THERE'S AN OLD BLACK TRAIN
A-COMIN' #.

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:03.290
# SCRAPING 'LONG THE IRON #.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.040
# YOU DON'T NEED NO TICKET, BOYS #.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.620
# IT'LL TAKE YOU IN IT'S TIME #.

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:16.390
Huh?

00:10:16.390 --> 00:10:18.130
Where... Huh?

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:20.140
Oh. You're awake.

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:22.140
Here, eat some dirt.

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:25.060
Uh, Beatrice?

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:26.630
You know my daughter!

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:27.640
Where is she?

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:29.190
I don't know.

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:31.310
Graaaaawr

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:33.900
Somebody left you and that frog on the doorstep.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:35.900
Beatrice.

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:36.750
But...

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:37.740
have you seen my brother?

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.570
No, I'm sorry.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:40.570
Uh, I gotta go!

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:43.700
You're in no shape to head into that snowstorm, young man.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.700
Here, here, eat more dirt.

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:47.660
Thanks.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:48.660
Come on, guy.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:49.670
Let's go find Greg.

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:52.170
At least wait until the
storm dies down a bit.

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:54.210
You'll be no good to your brother dead.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:56.540
I was never any good
to him alive, either.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:59.340
Thank you. Thank you so much.

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:03.850
If you see Beatrice again,

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:06.140
give her a hug for us.

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:07.600
Yeah.

